#: ../api/data_api.rst:4 2c12540174a446c7b2ec5875f6b621e9
msgid "Mapflow Data API"
msgstr "地图流数据 API"

#: ../api/data_api.rst:6 d854c3103b9e475cb08f4fafc082660b
msgid ""
"The Mapflow Data API enables you to manage custom imagery, organize it into "
"mosaics, and search satellite imagery from external providers. Use your "
"imagery for AI-powered analysis with the :doc:`Processing API "
"<processing_api>`."
msgstr ""
"Mapflow Data API 使您能够管理自定义图像、将其组织成马赛克以及从外部提供商搜索卫星图像。通过处理 API "
"<processing_api>` 使用您的图像进行 AI 支持的分析。"

#: ../api/data_api.rst 5f46bfa9d0d6423ebd3a857e84d2321d
msgid "Postman Collection"
msgstr "邮递员收藏"

#: ../api/data_api.rst:14 37f84fe24c3e4bf4a0c1c1c61f07aa91
msgid ""
"Try our `Postman Collection "
"<https://documenter.getpostman.com/view/5400715/2s935hS7ky>`_ for "
"interactive API testing."
msgstr ""
"尝试我们的“Postman Collection "
"<https://documenter.getpostman.com/view/5400715/2s935hS7ky>”_进行交互式 API 测试。"

#: ../api/data_api.rst:18 d4d6062252e941d0b21b44a7262b0e8c
msgid "Base URL"
msgstr "基本网址"

#: ../api/data_api.rst:26 6ff6cf0043194d9a812cb5abf124ffb4
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../api/data_api.rst:28 b0df33094eb440e6899352025c0fff09
msgid ""
"All API requests require an API token. Generate yours in `profile settings "
"<https://app.mapflow.ai/account>`_."
msgstr ""
"所有 API 请求都需要 API 令牌。在“配置文件设置 <https://app.mapflow.ai/account>”中生成您的配置文件设置。"

#: ../api/data_api.rst:35 19cd0b6292684b95ac7aaf6e5d20cd45
msgid ""
"See :doc:`authorization guide <../userguides/mapflow_auth>` for details."
msgstr "有关详细信息，请参阅:doc:`授权指南 <../userguides/mapflow_auth>`。"

